VanillaSU kernel/manager/apk_sign.c: bring the APK signing-block parser to upstream's fixed one.
Applies in the VanillaSU tree (git -C VanillaSU apply), pinned at 1fadf987e86c.

Upstream: tiann/KernelSU e6cc0ef7b0 "Align signature block parsing with AOSP" (CAN-2026-2035133: the old
loop looked at only the first ten blocks, so ten v2 blocks of the official manager plus a valid v3 block got
accepted by the kernel) and aa08b390cd "Reject all signature block id except v2". Ported from the same code in
KernelSU-Next legacy 165b87fa99ab (apk_sign.c:79-297), which already carries both. Kept as VanillaSU had it:
the v1-signature refusal (has_v1_signature_file), ksu_filp_open_compat, and the manager table.

